Package: standviz
Title: 3D Visualisation of Stands Simulated with 'plant'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Daniel", "Falster", email = "daniel.falster@unsw.edu.au",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Remko", "Duursma", role = "ctb"))
Description: Turns the cohort size distributions simulated by the 'plant'
    forest model into explicit, persistent individual trees, and renders a
    stand growing through time as an interactive 3D page in the browser
    (three.js).
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    plant,
    stats
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Remotes:
    traitecoevo/plant@develop
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 8.0.0
